+        "became a genuine cross-domain localizer, whether it compounds, whether "
+        "detection is calibrated multi-domain, the ARC reproducible-total)."
+    ),
+    "localizer_state": (
+        "One of localizes_cross_domain_genuine / localizes_but_not_genuine / "
